-॥ॐ॥
+The Story of Rishabha Deva — दशकम् २० स्वाध्यायात् स्वाध्यायपर्यन्तम् ॐ Samskrita Svadhyaya ⌂ Texts A− A+ ☾ Dark ↩ Narayaneeyam ॐ The Story of Rishabha Deva
+दशकम् २०
+ॐ ॥ॐ॥
-प्रियव्रतस्य प्रियपुत्रभूतादाग्नीध्रराजादुदितो हि नाभिः ।त्वां दृष्टवानिष्टदमिष्टिमध्ये तवैव तुष्ट्यै कृतयज्ञकर्मा ॥ 20.1॥
-Word-by-word meaning: प्रियव्रतस्य of Priyavrata, प्रिय-पुत्र-भूतात् born as the beloved son, आग्नीध्र-राजात् from King Agnidhra, उदितः born, हि indeed, नाभिः King Nabhi, त्वाम् You, दृष्टवान् saw, इष्ट-दम् the bestower of desires, इष्टि-मध्ये in the middle of the sacrifice, तव You, एव alone, तुष्ट्यै for the pleasing/satisfaction, कृत-यज्ञ-कर्मा performing sacrificial rites
-Simple Meaning: King Nabhi was born as the beloved son of King Agnidhra, who was the son of Priyavrata. While performing sacred sacrificial rites solely to please You, King Nabhi was blessed to behold You, the granter of all desires, appearing right in the middle of his sacrifice.
-अभिष्टुतस्तत्र मुनीश्वरैस्त्वं राज्ञः स्वतुल्यं सुतमर्थ्यमानः ।स्वयं जनिष्येऽहमिति ब्रुवाणः तिरोदधा बर्हिषि विश्वमूर्ते ॥ 20.2 ॥
-Word-by-word meaning: अभिष्टुतः praised, तत्र there, मुनीश्वरैः by the great sages, त्वम् You, राज्ञः of the king, स्व-तुल्यम् equal to Yourself, सुतम् a son, अर्थ्यमानः being requested, स्वयम् Yourself, जनिष्ये I shall be born, अहम् I, इति thus, ब्रुवाणः saying, तिरोदधाः disappeared, बर्हिषि in the sacrificial fire, विश्वमूर्ते O Lord of the cosmic form
-Simple Meaning: The sages sang Your praises and the king prayed to You for a son like Yourself. Replying that You Yourself would be born as his son, You disappeared into the sacrificial fire, O Lord of the cosmic form!
-नाभिप्रियायामथ मेरुदेव्यां त्वमंशतोऽभूः ॠषभाभिधानः ।अलोकसामान्यगुणप्रभावप्रभाविताशेषजनप्रमोदः ॥ 20.3 ॥
